          "date": "2026-06-09T20:55:10Z"
        },
        "message": "docs(readme): use autoplaying GIFs for the demo clips\n\nGitHub does not autoplay <video> tags in a README (they render at most as a\nclick-to-play player, and only on a public repo), so the embedded mp4s did\nnot play. Replace them with looping, autoplaying GIFs embedded via <img> with\nrelative media/ paths \u2014 these animate inline with no click and render even on\na private repo (same mechanism as the logo). The clips were encoded at\n480px/10fps with an optimized palette (RL 680K, ACT 1.9M, Diffusion 2.1M).",
